	optdepends = python-llama-index: RAG knowledge-base engine (Settings → Knowledge Base)
	optdepends = python-llama-index-retrievers-bm25: BM25 retriever for the LlamaIndex RAG engine
	optdepends = python-llama-index-vector-stores-faiss: FAISS vector store plugin (large KBs; falls back to SimpleVectorStore if absent)
	optdepends = python-pocketbase: PocketBase storage backend
	optdepends = python-json-repair: Repair malformed JSON in LLM responses
	optdepends = python-nest_asyncio: Allow nested asyncio event loops (required by some notebook / code-exec flows)
